Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,《超人4：和平任务》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:31.87,Note,,0,0,0,,要唱歌回家唱 辛纳屈同志
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:37.11,Note,,0,0,0,,在家里 大家都叫我到外太空唱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:58.55,Note,,0,0,0,,在这里唱歌比较安全
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:14.31,Note,,0,0,0,,(小镇)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:18.32,Note,,0,0,0,,(出售或出租)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.44,0:12:42.15,Note,,0,0,0,,(大都会)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:49.31,Note,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:52.99,Note,,0,0,0,,[法语]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:14.40,Note,,0,0,0,,(帮助我们 帮助你)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:19.39,Note,,0,0,0,,[法语]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.24,0:13:28.99,Note,,0,0,0,,(大都会捷运)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:12.59,Note,,0,0,0,,(让火炬永燃)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.35,0:15:48.66,Note,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.64,0:23:30.47,Note,,0,0,0,,(超人以沉默 回应小孩子)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.60,0:34:09.63,Note,,0,0,0,,(发射)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.96,0:39:33.83,Note,,0,0,0,,(美国空军 梅森堡基地)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.48,0:40:11.51,Note,,0,0,0,,(美国空军)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.04,1:02:03.51,Note,,0,0,0,,真是伟大的奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.28,1:02:06.95,Note,,0,0,0,,没什么 祝大家愉快
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.72,1:05:28.30,Note,,0,0,0,,(蕾西华菲尔出版社)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.76,1:05:46.79,Note,,0,0,0,,(超人已死)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.60,1:12:30.59,Note,,0,0,0,,(你最爱的报刊的新发行人)
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.12,1:15:30.27,Note,,0,0,0,,(危险 电梯绞缆室)
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.32,1:21:37.59,Note,,0,0,0,,(华菲尔出版社)
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.80,1:21:39.63,Note,,0,0,0,,(星球日报)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.56,1:25:06.83,Note,,0,0,0,,(男孩之家)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,请仔细听…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen carefully...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,吾儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.37,0:06:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 凯尔…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By now, Kal-El...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经进入一个 叫做地球的星球的大气层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... you are entering the atmosphere of the planet known as Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我祈祷你一路平安抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pray you have made a safe journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你新家的黄色太阳 将赋予你巨大的能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The yellow sun of your new home will give you great physical powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.59,0:06:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可是却不能抚慰你的心灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it cannot console your spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这艘太空船上面装有个 能源小艇…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Placed aboard this vessel is an energy module...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,装载一个曾经强大的文明 所遗留下来的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... all that remains of a once-powerful civilization:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是氪星 你的故乡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Krypton, your mother planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我送给你最后的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my last gift to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只要拿掉这个礼物 这艘小艇就会冷却 沉寂…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once removed, the ship will grow cold and silent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,然后此会完全剩下你一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... and you will be finally alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,小艇上的能量只能使用一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power in the module can be used but once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.99,0:07:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,务必谨慎使用 吾儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use it wisely, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 你在吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark, you out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark Kent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.13,0:07:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 洪斯比先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Mr. Hornsby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:07:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在这里  - 你好吗 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There you are.  - How are you, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.53,0:08:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我很好 克拉克 你呢？  - 很高兴又能见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm fine, Clark. How are you?  - Nice to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.87,0:08:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 已经好久不见了  - 好久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's been a long time.  - A long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你到的时候我正好在忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was tidying up for when you show the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.81,0:08:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我有没有跟你提到 有人连看都没看就说要买？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't I mention there was an offer to buy, sight unseen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.81,0:08:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想把这地方 卖给炒作土地的开发商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to sell this place to a big developer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.15,0:08:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,买家必须想买真正的农场才行 不可以再弄出一个购物中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The buyer has to want a real farm, not another shopping center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,得了 克拉克 你为何如此固执？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now darn it, Clark, why are you so stubborn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.32,0:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在已经没有人想买农场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, nobody wants a farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你眨个眼睛 一切就全不见了 这才叫进化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You blink your eye and they'll all be gone. That's progress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的天 看看这东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my gosh, look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 老强纳森肯特 是个爱开玩笑的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what a joker old Jonathan Kent was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.87,0:08:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有一次 我问他 这婴儿床怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I asked him what happened to the baby's crib.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he said:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"一定是小克拉克 做恶梦时踢到了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Oh, little Clark must've had a bad dream and kicked it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我发誓 我爸很喜欢讲笑话  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I swear, Dad liked a good joke.  - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我想 也许你愿意代你的孙子 收下这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wondering, maybe you'd like to keep these for your grandchildren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 谢谢你了 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, thank you very much, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来 打一球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, batter up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 不  - 好啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no.  - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 真的…  - 我们打几球就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, really...  - We'll hit a few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,小心了 我的球速很快的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out now, these will come in pretty fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是打不到变化球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never could hit a curve ball!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我对此地最终的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my final decision about the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.21,0:09:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我要保留给真正的农夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm holding out for a real farmer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.29,0:09:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的跟你老爸一样顽固\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're just as obstinate as your father was too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 不过就是这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, but that's just the way it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你回大都会以后 要多多保重 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You be careful when you get back to Metropolis, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一个距离你的故乡 很远很远的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long, long way from where you were born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 先生 我谨记在心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. I never forget that, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.58,0:09:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见  - 再见 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye.  - Bye, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.10,0:10:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你在吹什么 怪难听的噪音？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that God-awful noise you're making?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,莫札特 我的猪脑袋朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mozart, my low-forehead friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,即使是在这悲惨的狗屎地方 也不能抹灭一个天才的心灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even this wretched pit can't diminish the spirit of true genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,生命的源头来自一个 类似此地般根深的地带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life itself started in a murky pit much like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,像我这种真正的天才 就是能掌握当下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A true genius like myself learns to seize the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你是第一个知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the first to know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我有计划要再造新生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that I now have plans to re-create life itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,路瑟 开始做工了 不然我们要把你丢去喂狼吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luthor, start breaking a sweat or we'll throw you to the wolves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.57,0:10:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,路瑟 也该搞脏你的衣服了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luthor, let's get them duds dirty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 动作快点 猪头  - 认真一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move it, meathead.  - Let's see a little sweat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那辆车在这里做什么？!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that car doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把那辆车给我拦下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop that vehicle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 停  - 停下来 小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, stop!  - Hold it there, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 这里是什么鬼地方 我要怎么去松柏市？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo! Where the hell is this and how the hell do I get to Cedar City?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你走错方向了 小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You on the wrong side of the state, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不会吧  - 哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No chance.  - Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你的音响超好 超级棒的 小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a fine, fine super-fine sound system here, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.06,0:11:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你们一定没见识过 这种百分百原音的环烧音响吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you dudes have never seen one of these Sensurround 100s?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.13,0:11:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我在杂志上看过一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I seen one once in a magazine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 快 上车来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, heck. Come on, get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的？  - 快上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really?  - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想听的 快上车  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanted to hear it, come on!  - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.45,0:11:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,上车 老土 我们来听一听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hop in, Bubba. Let's give it a listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, this is great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,车门…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doors...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,车窗…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Windows...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？  - 车顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's happening?  - The top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.53,0:11:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,座位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seats!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lordy! Lordy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.83,0:11:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,上路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎你们再回来探望我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Y'all come back and see us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我的表现还可以吧 雷克斯伯伯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I do okay or what, Uncle Lex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝尼 你一向是我这家族里 无用的寄生菌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lenny, you've always been the Dutch elm disease of my family tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这次 你做得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this time you did fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.27,0:12:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想到处看看吗 伯伯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna skip the country, Uncle Lex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.97,0:12:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你这公立学校出来的蠢东西…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pathetic product of the public schools...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,自从我被关之后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I've had nothing on my awesome mind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我伟大的脑子里就只有一件事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...since I've been incarcerated except one thing:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.64,0:12:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 摧毁超人  - 摧毁超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Destroy Superman!  - Destroy Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,救命哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.01,0:13:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody get help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.59,0:13:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他没事的 看个医生就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's okay. He needs a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 请等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, one moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.69,0:14:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望大家都能了解 我们的地下铁系统…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want people to know that our subway system...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是最安全也是最可靠的 大众交通工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is the safest and most reliable means of public transit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.46,0:14:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.37,0:14:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你迟到了 肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're late, Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.17,0:14:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 怀特先生 以后不会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Mr. White, won't happen again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.11,0:14:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都上哪里去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is everybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.11,0:14:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,乏味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tedious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.88,0:14:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 怎么一回事？  - 糟透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, what's going on?  - Abominable!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看 是大卫华菲尔  - 大卫华菲尔…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Regardez, voil? David Warfield.  - David Warfield...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,拥有那些三流小报的巨头？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who owns those sleazy tabloids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 是拥有那些三流小报 以及《星球日报》的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Au contraire. Who owns all those sleazy tabloids and The Daily Planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,乏味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tedious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你只看照片而已吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You only read the pictures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,怀特先生 事实上 我只读帐册\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact is, Mr. White, that I only read the ledger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是被我买下的 前一任的业主…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A ledger which the previous owners paid so little attention to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没关心到的帐册\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I bought the paper from them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.61,0:15:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这三年来《星球日报》根本没赚钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Daily Planet hasn't made any money in three years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们这游戏的名称就是赚钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the name of the game is making money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,各位女士 各位先生 我的女儿 蕾西华菲尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, my daughter, Lacy Warfield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.36,0:15:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 爸爸  - 很荣幸认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, Daddy.  - It's nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怀特先生 蕾西将会协助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. White, Lacy will be helping you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,协助我？协助我什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Helping me? Helping me what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我有带新版面的一些草稿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have some mock copies of our new layout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,很棒 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's super.Don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.47,0:15:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,服装不太对 我们可以更正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The suit's not right, but we can change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 华菲尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Mr. Warfield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:15:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,世界并非真有毁灭的危机 这样的标题会不会太耸动了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world isn't really on the brink. Isn't that headline irresponsible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,也许 不过这样会很有卖点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe, but it'll sell a lot of newspapers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怀特先生 别冲动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. White, don't do anything rash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让这家伟大的报社 变成你旗下的蠢货…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't let you turn this grand old lady into one of your bimbos...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,怀特先生 容我指出 我爸爸拥有所有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. White, may I point out that Daddy holds all of your contracts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.56,0:16:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你得遵守的合约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which you will have to honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 你这娇娇女…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excusez-moi, your spoiled-ness...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝为什么老是讲法语？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is Lois speaking French?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我还得赶飞机到巴黎 去参加临时部长会议…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I have a plane to catch to Paris for the emergency Ministers' Conference...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不用赶了 所有的出差全部取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so fast. All trips are canceled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说我到巴黎的旅行 取消了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean my trip to Paris is canceled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.54,0:16:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,怀特先生 你跟我来一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. White, you come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.95,0:16:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我要看你的帐册 其他的人全回去工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see your books. Everyone get back to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这对我们是不公平的 我要去找蕾西谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not being treated fairly. I'm speaking to Lacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.95,0:16:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 华菲尔小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Miss Warfield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我代表全体向你说 我们会尽量地配合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I speak for us all when I say we'll do our best to cooperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可是记者的第一要务 是忠于真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a reporter's first allegiance is to the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.93,0:16:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这座城市的人民仰赖我们 我们不能让他们失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people of this city depend on us and we can't let them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:16:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他是玩真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he for real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.51,0:17:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,百分百 我就喜欢他这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}100 percent, and I like him that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你对他有好感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you have a thing for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.55,0:17:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,对克拉克？没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Clark?! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他是有点可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's kind of cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 华菲尔小姐…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Miss Warfield...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克是现存最老的童子军 知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Clark is the oldest living boy scout, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他可信赖 他很愿意帮忙…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trustworthy, he's helpful...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他忠心 他很听话 他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he's loyal, he's obedient, he...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.97,0:17:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么对你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how to tell you this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为他不会被你这样的女孩吸引\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't think he'd be attracted to somebody like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别傻了 全世界的男人都喜欢我 我可是很有钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be silly. All men like me. I'm very, very rich!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.28,0:17:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么没有出差的飞机旅费 肯特先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are there no air travel expenses for you, Mr. Kent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.02,0:17:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我会晕机 尤其是遇到乱流的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get airsick, especially when it's bumpy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.49,0:17:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝 进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, get in here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.59,0:17:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝 说明一下这一栏数字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, explain this column of figures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.79,0:17:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老编 总统要上现场了  - 什么 现在吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The president is coming on live.  - What, right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一定不是好消息  - 你总是反应过度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It won't be very good news.  - You always overreact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没那么糟糕的  - 但愿很糟 莲恩小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It won't be that terrible.  - Hopefully very terrible, Miss Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.81,0:18:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有个国际危机 我们就可以创造两倍的发行量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can double our circulation with an international crisis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.04,0:18:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,由于高峰会的失败…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And because the summit has failed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们别无选择 只好努力成为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... we have no choice but to strive to be second to none...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,核武竞赛的第一强国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... in the nuclear arms race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因此 我在此宣布 如下方案…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore, I am announcing the following measures...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们对于这个危机 感到很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're all upset by the crisis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也只能尽量往正面来思考\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best thing we can do is to try to think positively.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我们能不能做什么？ 有没有人有什么建议的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, is there anything we can do? Doesn't anyone have a suggestion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我来建议好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I'll make a suggestion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们何不写信给我们的国会议员？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we write to our congressman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没什么用的  - 人总得乐观一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That'll do a lot of good.  - Somebody has to be an optimist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,杰洛米？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeremy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这种危机 我们该怎样？  - 他根本在状况外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What could we do about the crisis?  - He doesn't know what's going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道可以写信给 真正能做事情的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know who I'd write a letter to that would do some good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.47,0:19:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁？圣诞老人吗？  - 不 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? Santa Claus?  - No, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 也就是我们展览的主轴…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman, the subject of our exhibit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他捐出一楼发丝给博物馆…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has donated a strand of his hair to the museum...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好让我们得以观察他的神力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so we can have the fun of seeing how strong he really is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大家在此看到的 是一千磅的重物…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you see a 1000-pound load...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.51,0:19:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,用他的一根头发就可轻易吊起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...easily suspended by his single hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,博物馆即将关闭 所以我们行动应该快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The museum will be closing soon, so we should hurry a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我用超人的一根发丝 能做出什么来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know what I can do with a single strand of Superman's hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,做出一顶会飞的假发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could make a toupee that flies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这根发丝是超人的基因样本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That hair is a sample of Superman's genetic material.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.57,0:19:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是他那身躯的基础\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The building blocks of his body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.17,0:19:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,以我的聪明才智加上足够的核能 就可以使基因突变…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With my genius and enough nuclear power to mutate the genes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以创造出比他更有威力的人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I can create a being who's more powerful than him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.31,0:19:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而且只忠于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With total allegiance to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好退后 眼睛闭起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better stand back. Keep your eye out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 华菲尔小姐 你要见我吗？  - 嗨 克拉克 请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Miss Warfield, you wanted to see me?  - Hi, Clark. Please come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.30,0:20:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个很棒的好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come up with a brilliant idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.13,0:20:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 真的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我爸认为很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Daddy thinks it's brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.73,0:20:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你写一个新的系列报导 就叫《下班后的大都会》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to write a new series called "Metropolis After Hours."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,叫谁 我吗？我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who, me? I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是很棒 很好的点子 对不对？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's wonderful. It's great, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不觉得这份差事适合我做  - 哦 你最适合了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think I'd be right for this.  - Oh, you're perfect for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 你年轻 你单身 你很成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you're young, you're single, you're successful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.15,0:21:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我通常十点半说上床了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm usually in bed by 10:30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.02,0:21:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样 你不必引人注目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just it, see, you don't have to flaunt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 你不是赶流行的人 不过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you're no slave to fashion. Although...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.86,0:21:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有没有想过戴隐形眼镜？  - 我的眼睛会痒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...have you ever thought of contacts?  - They make my eyes itch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,放心好了 我想我们可以合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it. I thought we could do this together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦？  - 我知道所有合适的地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh?  - I know all the right places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.27,0:21:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的夜间俱乐部 我都是会员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a member of all the right clubs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.37,0:21:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们此从今夜的 大都会俱乐部开慕酒会开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll start tonight at the opening of the Metro Club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 今夜  - 对 就算约会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, tonight.  - Yeah, it's a date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.41,0:21:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A date!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,约会？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A date?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 其实只是公事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's just business, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.12,0:21:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我这里有一封要给超人的信 由我转交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a letter here for Superman, care of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？  - 超人在这里收信？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - Superman gets mail here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.89,0:21:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,很可能是要照片的 我来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's probably a picture request. I can take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这不只是一个超人迷的来信 你应该看看内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's more than just a fan letter. You should read it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"亲爱的超人 我的老师 谈到总统核武竞赛的演讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dear Superman, my teacher spoke about the president's speech on the arms race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.07,0:22:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们全都感到非常不快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all very unhappy about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该请超人 为这世界去除所有的核武…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I said we should get Superman to rid the world of nuclear arms...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.81,0:22:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因为只有他办得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because only he could do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦你摧毁所有的核武飞弹 大家此知道我是正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you've destroyed all the nuclear missiles, they'll see I'm right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,超人可以轻松迅速地 确保我们不把自己炸翻天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman can make sure we don't blow ourselves up, quick and easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.39,0:22:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你会前来相助的 你的朋友 杰洛米敬上"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you'll come through. Your friend, Jeremy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼 哦 我最好快点回去工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor kid. Oh, well, I better get back to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.07,0:22:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 这东西是有观点的  - 观点 他只是个小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, there's an angle in this.  - An angle! He's just a kid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.07,0:22:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我老爸就喜欢这种煽情的活动 哦 天啊 社会大众也会爱死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy loves whipping up campaigns. Oh, boy, and the public loves it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.08,0:22:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lacy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.28,0:22:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要让他成为名人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll make him a celebrity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.85,0:22:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,世上的每一个人都会好奇 超人要如何答覆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody in the world is gonna be wondering what Superman's reply is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.45,0:22:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到大都会 杰洛米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Metropolis, Jeremy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.82,0:22:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我是华菲尔先生 她是我的女儿蕾西华菲尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Mr. Warfield and this is my daughter, Lacy Warfield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.59,0:22:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 杰洛米  - 请过来跟媒体见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Jeremy.  - Now come along and meet the press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.53,0:23:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你可别绊倒  - 我坐的车有个轮胎没气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't you trip.  - The car had a flat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.20,0:23:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉听到这个小意外 转身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to hear that. Turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.27,0:23:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,让大家给你拍个照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let everybody get a picture of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 此这样 各位  - 这边 杰洛米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's it, everyone.  - Here, Jeremy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.14,0:23:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,多俊的一个孩子 来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a boy! Now come along...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.87,0:23:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对美国大众说说 你刚刚对我说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and tell the American public what you told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.25,0:23:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 我希望超人能答应我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just said I wish Superman would've said yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们听到了没？  - 没 我们没听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you get that?  - No, we didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.32,0:23:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 再说一次 大声点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, say it again. Loudly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.85,0:23:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚说 我希望超人能答应我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just said I wish Superman would've just said yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.03,0:23:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,莲 巴小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Lane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.47,0:23:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,莲 巴小姐 看看这个 刚出炉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Lane. Take a look at this. Hot off the press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.70,0:23:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这一次他太过分了 你看 克拉克 你看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time he's gone too far. Look, Clark. Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,等不及要看我们家老编的反应了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't wait to see the chief's reaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.31,0:23:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再当软柿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm through taking it lying down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.38,0:23:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要找我的话 我在市中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody wants me, I'll be downtown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.58,0:23:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,老编是不是不太一样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief look different to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.75,0:23:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我老爸 要去银行借钱的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks like my father when he went to the bank to ask for a loan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.09,0:23:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我去确定他是否没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna make sure he's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.53,0:24:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在也没办法了 全看超人的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing we can do about it. It's Superman's decision now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.86,0:24:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信他会做出正确的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure he'll do the right thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.04,0:24:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,愿长者关照你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the elders watch over you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.31,0:24:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,吾儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.14,0:24:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的智慧 是一个曾经强大与先进的星球…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their wisdom is all that is left of a once powerful...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.91,0:24:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,仅剩的结晶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... and enlightened planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.85,0:25:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定得倾听他们的声音 凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must listen to them, Kal-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,倾听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.43,0:25:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我不该干预\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I'm forbidden to interfere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.53,0:25:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但地球遭受到与氪星 相同的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet the Earth is threatened by the same fate as Krypton's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.14,0:25:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,地球太原始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Earth is too primitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.81,0:25:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以逃到新的世界…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can flee to new worlds...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.38,0:25:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,到一个不再有战争的地方去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where war is long forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.15,0:25:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你教导地球 把命运放在一个人的肩上…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you teach the Earth to put its fate in any one man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.05,0:25:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,即使那个人是你 也等于是教导他们被人背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...even yourself, you're teaching them to be betrayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.86,0:25:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,背叛…背叛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Betrayed... betrayed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.56,0:25:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,背叛…背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...betrayed... betrayed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.20,0:25:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,由于高峰会的失败…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And because the summit has failed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.94,0:25:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们别无选择…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... we have no choice but to strive...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.41,0:25:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,只好努力成为 核武竞赛的第一强国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... to be second to none in the nuclear arms race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.78,0:26:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,为达这个目的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To that end...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.48,0:26:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,本行政团队矢志追求…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... this administration has pursued...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.72,0:26:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,且将持续追求…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... and will continue to pursue...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.72,0:26:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,最有效的政策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... the most vigorous policy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.19,0:26:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,因此…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.19,0:26:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.37,0:26:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 露易丝？  - 你在 怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lois?  - There you are. What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.17,0:26:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么怎么了？  - 没什么 只不过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean, what happened?  - Nothing, just:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.20,0:26:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"六点大厅见 一起参加颁奖晚宴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Meet in the lobby at 6 for the awards dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.87,0:26:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,正式穿着 不要迟到"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wear something nice and don't be late."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.31,0:26:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 难道你是对别的露易丝说的吗？  - 我很抱歉 我完全忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Was it some other Lois?  - I'm sorry, I completely forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.32,0:26:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好 你穿上你的燕尾服 我们出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, go get your penguin suit on and we'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.72,0:26:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不介意的话 我不想去 我还有很多事得想一想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather not, if you don't mind. I've got a lot of thinking to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.46,0:26:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 你去吧 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you go ahead. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.53,0:26:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.56,0:26:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么麻烦吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.93,0:27:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能帮忙吗？  - 是的 事实上 你能帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is there anything I can do?  - Yes, you can, as a matter of fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.37,0:27:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？  - 我们出去呼吸一下新群空气好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - Could we go get some fresh air?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.41,0:27:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,新群空气？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fresh air?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.08,0:27:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,新群空气 新鲜空气 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fresh air. Fresh air, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.15,0:27:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 克拉克 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, Clark. Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.35,0:27:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谁稀罕配菜一堆的好吃鸡肉呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who needs chicken with all the fixings anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.99,0:27:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们走 快 咱们去呼吸新鲜的空气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Come on. Let's get some fresh air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.96,0:27:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,吸气 你觉得好一点了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe. Do you feel better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.16,0:27:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.33,0:27:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克？克拉克 事情没那么糟 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark? Clark, things aren't that bad! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.30,0:27:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Clark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.27,0:27:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark! Clark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.48,0:27:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.20,0:28:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.83,0:28:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.65,0:28:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你看那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.26,0:28:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,放手 拜拜啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go. Bye-bye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.49,0:29:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喜不喜欢一个人飞？  - 我喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd you like going solo?  - I loved it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.66,0:29:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 更喜欢跟你一起飞翔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not as much as being with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.83,0:29:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我也需要和你在一起 你给我带来欢笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed to be with you too. You make me laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.67,0:29:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是唯一可以跟我谈的人 露易丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only one I can talk to, Lois.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.27,0:29:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有的时候我也不知道 该怎么做才好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, sometimes I don't know what I'm supposed to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.78,0:29:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远可以来找我 你是知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm always here for you, you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.18,0:29:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 你都会做出正确的决定 你一向都可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll do the right thing, no matter what. You always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.32,0:29:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.66,0:29:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道吗？  - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know something?  - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.96,0:29:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你甚至不晓得我的名字  - 凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't even know my name.  - Kal-El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.13,0:29:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你记得的 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.07,0:29:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.94,0:29:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"不要偏爱一人 要博爱全人类"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Never set one of them above the rest. Love all humanity instead."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.24,0:29:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.44,0:30:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.87,0:30:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝 该走了 我们快迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, it's time to go. We'll be late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.28,0:30:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我干嘛跑到外面来 冻死人了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I doing out here freezing my butt off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.31,0:30:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你想要呼吸新鲜的空气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you wanted some fresh air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.89,0:30:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不 没关系 我可不要受冻威冒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no that's okay. I don't want to catch a cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.46,0:30:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得怪怪的 好像有点虚脱的成觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel kind of weird, like I'm jetlagged or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.03,0:30:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哎呀  - 我好像疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jeepers!  - Like I'm going crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.80,0:30:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你呢？你的心情还不好吗？  - 没 事情很清楚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How about you? Are you still down?  - Nope. Things are pretty clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.70,0:30:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 想太多会让你没电的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Too much thinking wears down your batteries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.24,0:31:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 你得提起勇气向前走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark, you gotta go with your gut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.95,0:31:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.09,0:31:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好 给你 杰洛米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, here you go, Jeremy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.12,0:31:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,华菲尔先生想给你拍一些 带本地色彩的东西…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Warfield wants me to get shots of you with local color...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.69,0:31:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我还没什么点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I can't think of anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.13,0:31:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 杰洛米  - 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Jeremy.  - Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.96,0:31:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.63,0:31:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的独家报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a scoop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.50,0:31:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想散散步吗？  - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd you like to take a walk?  - Sure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.84,0:31:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米 走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.65,0:31:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不行 你的车会被拖吊的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't! You'll get towed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.89,0:31:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道一张罚单要多少钱吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how much a ticket costs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.43,0:31:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾西 钱财乃身外之物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lacy, it's only money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.87,0:32:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,杰洛米 你可以在楼上的回廊等我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you wait for me upstairs in the gallery?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.67,0:32:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,当然好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.87,0:32:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝你幸运 超人  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good luck, Superman.  - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.25,0:32:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你留了座位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saved you a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.19,0:32:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.43,0:32:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不代表任何国家 不过我想向各位代表发言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't represent any country but I'd like to address the delegates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.10,0:32:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那你需要有与会国附议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, in that case, you will need a sponsor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.61,0:32:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我想这样子就可以了 请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe that will do. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.21,0:32:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.58,0:32:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他要说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he gonna say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.75,0:32:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,说很好的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.72,0:32:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,秘书长女士…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam Secretary...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.86,0:32:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,各位可敬的代表 各位女士 各位先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...honorable delegates, ladies and gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.53,0:32:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,多年来 我作为一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For many years now I've lived among you as...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.80,0:33:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,与大家常在一起的过客 我欣赏你们许多文化的美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a visitor. I've seen the beauty of your many cultures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.30,0:33:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我成受到你们许多成就的喜悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've felt joy in your magnificent accomplishments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.94,0:33:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我也见识到许多愚昧的战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've also seen the folly of your wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.74,0:33:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,直到今天 我不再是一个过客 因为地球…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As of today I'm not a visitor anymore, because the Earth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.11,0:33:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,已经是我的家乡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is my home too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.68,0:33:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能活在恐惧中 我无法置身事外…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't live in fear. And I can't stand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.59,0:33:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,目睹我们疯狂的跌入…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...idly by and watch us stumble into the madness...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.32,0:33:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可能的核子毁灭危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of possible nuclear destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.92,0:33:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经有了决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come to a decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.33,0:33:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我要执行我们各个政府 不愿意或无法去执行的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to do what our governments have been unwilling to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.30,0:33:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在开始 我要着手去除 我们这星球所有的核子武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Effective immediately, I'm going to rid our planet of all nuclear weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.94,0:33:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.78,0:33:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,说得好 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to go, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.59,0:34:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,飞弹初步测试 所有系统运作正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missile test Alpha, all systems go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.93,0:34:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three... two... one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.68,0:35:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.98,0:36:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 很高兴看到大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Nice to see you guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.55,0:36:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你们何不放轻松 我来给大家介绍一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just relax there. I'll get on with the introductions:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.05,0:36:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,迪丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dixie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.95,0:36:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,以及崔丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Trixie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.96,0:36:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,来自我们的自由大地 与透支王国的哈利霍乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the land of the free, the home of the great cost overrun, Harry Howler:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.06,0:36:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他是美国最高阶智库的 核武战略家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nuclear strategist from America's top think tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.57,0:36:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,也是独立作业的伟大战争贩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a great little warmonger in his own right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.34,0:36:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,接着 我们由衷欢迎 尚皮耶柏博斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hearty bienvenue to Jean-Pierre Dubois:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.71,0:36:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他是全球的核子弹头交易商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nuclear warhead dealer to the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.81,0:36:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他的座右铭是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His motto is:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.81,0:36:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"如果你不是向尚皮耶买的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If you didn't buy it from Jean-Pierre...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.31,0:36:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你就不是买到黑市价格"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you didn't buy it on the black market."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.55,0:36:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,罗莫夫将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Romoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.85,0:36:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,许多人视你为"俄国疯子"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of people think of you as the "Mad Russian."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.62,0:36:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我则视你为疯狂才子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to think of you as just madly eccentric.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.73,0:36:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please be seated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.46,0:36:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我知道你们都感到激动 有点难以平复…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look guys. I know you're all choked up, kind of overcome with joy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.57,0:37:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,超人终结武器竞赛 所带来的喜悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that Superman has ended the arms race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.87,0:37:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 只要我们合作无问 我们此可以确保全世界…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we work together, we can make the world safe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.68,0:37:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,战争利润的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for war profits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.41,0:37:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦你说重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.81,0:37:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,重点在于 我 雷克斯路瑟 当代最伟大的犯罪者…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The point is, I, Lex Luthor, greatest criminal mind of the modern era...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.65,0:37:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,已经找到一个摧毁超人的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...have found a way to destroy Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.15,0:37:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,请看 我严谨的好友…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold, my unscrupulous friends...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.32,0:37:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,把窗帘关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut those blinds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.86,0:37:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 阳光刺痛我的眼  - 就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The sun is hurting my eyes!  - Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.80,0:37:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道太阳是什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what the sun is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.60,0:37:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳只是一座巨大的核子弹…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing more than a huge nuclear bomb...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.60,0:37:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是一颗含有很多幅射能的炸弹 能将一个正常人化为灰烬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a bomb with so much radiation, it'd incinerate the average man like that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.94,0:37:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对 可是超人并非常人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but Superman is no average man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.31,0:37:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aha, right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.38,0:37:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么计划？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.52,0:37:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我这个老雷克斯 有个秘密配方…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys, old Lex here has kind of a secret recipe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.62,0:37:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这道主菜可以称之为基因浓汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a genetic stew in this dish, if you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.06,0:37:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你们帮我把这东西 放在你们的一个飞弹上面…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'll help me put this on one of your missiles...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.09,0:38:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以保证 超人就会得到 他一生中最大的意外惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I promise you, Superman will have the biggest surprise of his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.33,0:38:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把他介绍给他的第一个噩梦 一个"核能超人"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll introduce him to his first nightmare, a "Nuclear Man."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.57,0:38:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他将会刺穿超人的皮肤 他将可让超人变常人 变病人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll pierce his skin. He'll make him mortal. He'll become sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.14,0:38:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将可在超人的坟上起舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll dance on his grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.58,0:38:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们干嘛跟你这种 恶名昭彰的坏蛋打交道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should we deal with a notorious scoundrel like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.25,0:38:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了我的座右铭…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember my motto:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.65,0:38:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"制造的恐惧愈多 换取的战利品说愈多"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The more fear you make, the more loot you take."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.68,0:38:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,卖出的飞弹也愈多…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the more missiles you guys sell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.95,0:38:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对 那对你有什么好处呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but what's in it for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.66,0:38:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就是小小的佣金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tiny commission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.43,0:38:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,恰到好处的佣金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something appropriate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.87,0:38:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A number...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.70,0:38:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,后面跟着很多零的数目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with a lot of zeros behind it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.48,0:38:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lenny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.35,0:38:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,新的基因物质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new genetic material.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.88,0:38:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,小蓝尼…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, Leonard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.12,0:38:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你的雷克斯伯伯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your Uncle Lex...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.92,0:39:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,用这个从超人的头发细胞 培养出来的原生质…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with this protoplasm that I have grown from Superman's hair cells...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.76,0:39:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以复制再生系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will duplicate creation itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.26,0:39:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,纤维给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the fabric.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.00,0:39:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,伯伯 这一点点布是不够遮的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Lex, this ain't gonna cover him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.77,0:39:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,内部的电脑将会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The computer inside will...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.28,0:39:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,保留足够的材料 以维续我一向坚持的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...leave enough material to maintain the high moral standards...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.11,0:39:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,高道德标准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that I've always subscribed to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.72,0:39:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这代表什么吗 伯伯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know what this means, Uncle Lex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.99,0:39:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.25,0:39:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要为人父母了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.35,0:40:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字 士官？  - 约克 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your name, sergeant?  - York, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.89,0:40:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,稍息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At ease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.12,0:40:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,发射控制组 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch control. Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.36,0:40:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.73,0:40:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,发生气候的问题 我们必须暂缓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a weather problem. We gotta hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.86,0:40:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,暂缓？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.56,0:40:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字 孩子？  - 哥伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your name, son?  - Goram.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.73,0:40:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要说"哥伦 长官"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Goram, sir."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.24,0:40:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哥伦 长官  - 哥伦 你熟背你的规则簿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Goram, sir.  - Goram, you know your code book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.80,0:40:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.31,0:40:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,2706条 遇天候恶劣时 听我的命令发射 发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2706, inclement override. Fire on my command. Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.68,0:41:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 长官 准备发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Stand by to launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.25,0:41:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,十 九…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten... nine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.40,0:41:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没打到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.64,0:42:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,伸展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reach out.{\r}
