Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.92,0:42:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.62,0:42:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉克 你还好吗？  - 我最好坐下来看就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clark, are you okay?  - I think I better sit this one out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.93,0:42:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真的要吗？这是你报导 大都会年轻人的好题材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure? This would be great for your series on the young Metropolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.06,0:43:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再试一次 来嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try it again. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.17,0:43:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,二 三 四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two, three, four.{\r}
