Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.27,0:43:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我看不行  - 什么 你还好吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think so.  - What, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.82,0:43:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,28…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}28...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.35,0:43:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,29…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}29...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.65,0:43:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,33…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}33...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.35,0:43:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以了 很棒  - 好 现在轮你上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Done. Great.  - Okay, you try it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.76,0:43:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们帮你调高一点  - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's set it a little higher for you.  - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.13,0:43:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,往下压就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just push down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.67,0:43:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？快下来  - 需要帮忙吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? Just step down.  - Need some help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.84,0:43:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友不了解自己的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend doesn't know his own strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.24,0:43:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 这位是保罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark, this is Paul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.08,0:43:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是这里的健身教练  - 很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's a trainer here.  - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.15,0:43:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我有最适合你用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I got just the thing for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.75,0:43:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 小克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here, Clarky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.88,0:43:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clarky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.42,0:44:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的很好 还想帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's real nice of him to help me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.99,0:44:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他真的很行  - 来 试试这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's really good.  - Here, try this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.53,0:44:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉克 你没事吧？ - 嗯  - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clark! Are you okay? - Yeah. - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.97,0:44:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一分痛楚 一分收获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pain, no gain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.47,0:44:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真是一个浑球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez, what a jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.34,0:44:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never realized it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.04,0:44:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我认识的很多人 都是浑球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess a lot of people I know are jerks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.61,0:44:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你认为我也是个浑球 所以才一直迥避我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you think I'm one too. That's why you keep avoiding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.38,0:44:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不会 我完全没这种想法 我只是比较忙而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, I don't think that at all. Just been really busy, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.89,0:44:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.09,0:44:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道露易丝要采访超人 谈谈他的和平任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know Lois is doing that interview with Superman about his peace mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.92,0:44:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我在想 我们四个人 正好可以一起喝个下午茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I was thinking the four of us can get together and have high tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.36,0:44:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是很时髦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very chic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.03,0:44:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以把那些哑铃给我吗 克拉克？  - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you hand me those weights, Clark?  - Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.00,0:44:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 蕾西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, Lacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.50,0:44:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,早点到 从我的阳台看出去 景致很浪漫的 再见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come early. The view is so romantic from my balcony. See you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.67,0:44:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 当然 给你  - 不是那些 另一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, sure. Here.  - Not those! The other one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.11,0:44:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一分痛楚 一分收获？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pain, no gain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.56,0:45:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么声音？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.60,0:45:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克斯伯伯…你吓到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Lex... You're spooking me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.53,0:45:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.90,0:45:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,夫人 非常成谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam, thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.20,0:45:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是万能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.10,0:45:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克斯伯伯 他像…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Lex, he's like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.51,0:45:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他很美丽 他很完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's beautiful. He's perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.18,0:46:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 核能超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home, Nuclear Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.61,0:46:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你的父亲很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father's happy to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.46,0:46:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳的能量赋予他 内部自燃的热力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power of the sun has given him internally generated heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.27,0:46:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我是一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.17,0:46:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.71,0:46:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我是…什么？我是一个天才？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm... What? I'm a genius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.44,0:46:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我是万能的 我是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm incredible. I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.01,0:46:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.55,0:46:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我才是老子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the father now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.49,0:46:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你有我的嗓音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have my voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.95,0:46:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是你有我的嗓音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you have my voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.76,0:46:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了 是我制造你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just remember, I made you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.66,0:46:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你只是一个试验品 怪胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you're just an experiment, freako.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.03,0:46:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.80,0:46:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 糟了  - 我是试验品 我是怪胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no.  - I'm an experiment. I'm a freako.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.67,0:47:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说怪胎只是在开玩笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just kidding about that freako line!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.34,0:47:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,如果说这里有谁是怪胎的话 那一定是我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anybody's a freako around here, it's gotta be me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.08,0:47:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 哇 我跳霹雳舞了 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wow, I'm break dancing, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.52,0:47:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,酷毙了 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This rocks. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.32,0:47:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我能创造你 我也能摧毁你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made you. I can destroy you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.32,0:47:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.36,0:47:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就摧毁超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy Superman now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.83,0:47:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你这可爱的孩子 但还不要 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sweet thing. But not quite yet, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.06,0:47:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 我们来讨论 什么时间比较适合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here. We'll discuss when the proper time is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.54,0:47:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克斯伯伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Lex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.42,0:47:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.05,0:47:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他 就像…他冷掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's, like... He's, like, cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.19,0:47:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.66,0:47:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是他的弱点 是唯一能阻止他的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's his vulnerability. That's the only way he can be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.66,0:47:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.93,0:48:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝尼 我的大嘴巴侄儿 他的能量来自太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lenny, my loud-mouthed nephew, he gets his energy from the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.67,0:48:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,失去阳光 他说像夜间的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without it, he's like you at night:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.57,0:48:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一无是处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.95,0:48:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没有十全十美的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, nobody's perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.73,0:48:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前没参加过四人约会 很有趣 我看起来还可以吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never had a double date before. This is fun. How do I look?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.00,0:48:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,太性感了 就像你试穿过 那六套衣服一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Illegal. Like the last six dresses you tried on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.44,0:48:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 蕾西？ 我不想扫你的兴或怎样 不过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Lacy? I don't want to burst your bubble or anything but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.87,0:48:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克不会注意到你穿什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Clark's not gonna notice what you're wearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.41,0:48:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,会 他会 一定是克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, he will. There's Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.38,0:48:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好 调整一下 可以了 你看起来棒透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, fix that. There you go. You look great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.31,0:48:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许只是超人来了  - 不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe it's just Superman.  - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.92,0:48:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不会 超人的进场方式不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Superman makes a different kind of entrance.{\r}
