Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.10,0:49:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你有20块的零钱吗？ 司机没钱找零\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you break a 20? Driver didn't have any change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.17,0:49:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有 当然 我去拿我的皮包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure. Let me get my purse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.67,0:49:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 露易丝  - 嗨 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Lois.  - Hi, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.91,0:49:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉克  - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clark.  - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.94,0:49:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你没办法相信的 这是华菲尔先生交给我问超人的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not gonna believe this list of questions...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.75,0:49:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,问题一长串 你自己看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Mr. Warfield gave me to ask Superman. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.02,0:49:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"你是否为降低我们国防的 一种阴谋？"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Aren't you part of a plot to weaken our national defense?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.75,0:49:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 我的天啊  - 我相信只有他的智商降低了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my goodness.  - I think his gray matter is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.46,0:49:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我怎么能问他这种问题？  - 客气一点地问嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How will I ask him these questions?  - Well, politely I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.09,0:49:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看 我有18块钱 还有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see, I have 18 dollars and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.06,0:49:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 她真的很喜欢你 你要注意她穿的衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark, she really likes you, so notice the dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.27,0:49:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我的美国运通卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my American Express card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.10,0:49:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 衣服  - 嘿 衣服很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dress.  - Oh, hey, neat dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.04,0:49:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thanks. Be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.55,0:49:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.18,0:50:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是不同的进场方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, there's a different kind of entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.59,0:50:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 露易丝  - 哈罗 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Lois.  - Hello, Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.16,0:50:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.89,0:50:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.36,0:50:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 超人 这位是蕾西华菲尔 她是老板的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Superman, this is Lacy Warfield. She's the boss' daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.73,0:50:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗？你的衣服非常迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you do? That's a very attractive outfit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.30,0:50:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想我们最好开始访问了  - 失陪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think we better start our interview.  - Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.97,0:50:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,双对同行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two's company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.04,0:50:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 对了 对 对 我去找克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, right, yeah. Yeah, I'll go get Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.51,0:50:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他很可能在帮司机换轮胎 或在做什么善事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's probably helping the driver change a tire, or some other good deed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.52,0:50:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.89,0:50:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么东西这么香  - 哦 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Something smells wonderful.  - Oh, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.72,0:50:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我在煮扇贝 还有鸭子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm cooking some scallops and some duck...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.52,0:50:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,全是用最棒的香结酱 香槟烹调的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in this wonderful mushroom sauce with champagne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.23,0:50:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,以防我们事后肚子饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case we got hungry afterwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.00,0:50:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 稍后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.37,0:50:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必这么麻烦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't have gone to all that trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.04,0:51:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以进行访问了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we get on with the interview?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.51,0:51:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们 我们就进行访问了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, let's. Let's get on with the interview.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.45,0:51:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你没收飞弹的行动 有任何麻烦吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you had any trouble confiscating the missiles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.82,0:51:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,总是有一些不正常的坏份子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There always was the possibility that warped individuals...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.06,0:51:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,想对打击这种全球的善举 不过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would take advantage of the world's goodwill, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.77,0:51:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么不对劲的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there something wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.90,0:51:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的晚餐 我的晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! My dinner! My dinner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.01,0:51:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我 马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.24,0:51:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.22,0:51:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.26,0:51:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在想念你了 克拉克  - 哦 啊 嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I missed you, Clark.  - Oh. Ah, well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.43,0:51:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,跟露易丝 超人在一起很无聊 我们自己去疯一疯好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so boring with Lois and Superman. Let's do something wild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.43,0:51:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在等我们 这样很失礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gee, they're expecting us. It wouldn't be polite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.27,0:51:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.67,0:52:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人怎么能如此正直 却又如此诱人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can one man be so square and so delicious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.37,0:52:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们去聊天好了 如果我得去面对超人 那你也要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's go chitchat. If I have to face Superman, so do you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.45,0:52:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lacy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.45,0:52:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.12,0:52:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.44,0:52:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是没办法相信 我从没做过 如此完美的烤鸭 太神奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it! I never had duck turn out so perfectly. It's amazing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.41,0:52:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我在外面 露易丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out here, Lois.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.78,0:52:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.46,0:52:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是不是很美？  - 对 是很美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't it beautiful?  - Yes, it is beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.86,0:53:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,整个世界都很美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole world is beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.73,0:53:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直觉得像这么美好的时刻 就该与某一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always felt moments like this should be shared with someone you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.81,0:53:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,某一个你在乎的人共享\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone you care a lot about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.21,0:53:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那是门铃声吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that the doorbell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.68,0:53:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.40,0:53:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lacy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.27,0:53:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Clark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.30,0:53:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他原先是要走进电梯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He started to get in the elevator...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.67,0:53:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 算了 说来话长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, never mind, it's a long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.17,0:53:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克老是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It always is with Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.38,0:53:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 太好了 他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great, that's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.58,0:53:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉克？  - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clark?  - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.05,0:53:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,男侍者得注意方向才行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those bellboys ought to look where they're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.68,0:53:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,超人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.55,0:53:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我很高兴你回来了  - 晚餐好了吗？可以吃了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm so glad you're back.  - Is dinner ready? Can we eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.06,0:54:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 我们去坐下了  - 哦 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, let's go sit down.  - Oh, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.03,0:54:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起  - 我的天 不 没关系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry!  - My goodness! No, that's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.30,0:54:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不用弄了 克拉克 会沾到你的裤子上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just leave it there, Clark. It's stuck on your pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.57,0:54:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我去弄个抹布擦 对不起 马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, let me just get a rag. Excuse me, be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.31,0:54:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Clark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.91,0:54:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哈罗 超人娘子 哈罗 超人娘子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Dolly Hello, Dolly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.98,0:54:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴我又能回到 属于我的天地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so nice to have me back Where I belong{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.12,0:54:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,别太在意 忧郁的男孩 只有你听得到我的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be concerned, Blue Boy. You're the only one who can hear me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.66,0:54:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的私人频率 你可以称之为《雷克斯电视台》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my own private frequency. You might call it "Lex TV."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.53,0:54:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,往你的左边看 高大 黝黑的师哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look to your left, tall, dark and handsome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.20,0:54:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我打算将那栋大楼炸掉20层 误差值在一两层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna blow 20 stories off that building, give or take a floor or two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.21,0:54:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.88,0:54:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,男人哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.21,0:54:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿克拉克没事 我最好去看一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope Clark's okay. I better look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.45,0:54:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.78,0:55:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 不过临时有紧急的事 代我向华菲尔小姐道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, but an emergency's come up. My apologies to Miss Warfield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.22,0:55:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 可是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.69,0:55:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 带我一起去 我可以顺便采访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman! Take me with you! I can cover the story!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.46,0:55:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你有看到克拉克吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seen Clark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.67,0:55:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,猜猜我是谁？ 你的老朋友雷克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess who. It's your old friend Lex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.01,0:55:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我想 如果你真的藏了炸弹 你早此逃得远远的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suspect if you'd actually planted a bomb, you'd be miles away by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.45,0:55:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的侄儿蓝尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my nephew Lenny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.42,0:55:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他崇拜我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He worships me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.85,0:55:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,铁血汉子 哇 你这下子惨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dude of steel. Boy, are you gonna get it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.59,0:55:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真笨 我还以为 我可以瞒过一个超级英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silly me, thinking that I could fool a super guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.03,0:55:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你说对了 没有炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. No bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.67,0:55:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,只是你忙着做世界和平的事情…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just that you're so involved in this world peace bit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.37,0:55:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,根本没空拜访老朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you don't have time for social calls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.21,0:55:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我坦承 我骗你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I confess, I tricked you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.41,0:55:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.54,0:56:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别客套了 你到底想干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind the small talk. What are you up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.08,0:56:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你是个工作狂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you're a workaholic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.02,0:56:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你一天24小时当好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're playing a good guy 24 hours a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.05,0:56:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,何不停下脚步 闻闻玫瑰花香？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you stop and smell the roses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.42,0:56:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,或培养个嗜好？养只宠物？ 小猫 小狗这类的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get yourself a hobby? A pet? A kitten, a puppy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.82,0:56:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都知道你讨厌小孩跟动物 你回大都会来干什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you hate children and animals. What are you doing back in Metropolis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.40,0:56:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我想把在我们这里混的新角色 第一个介绍给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be first to introduce you to the new kid on the block.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.51,0:56:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细看看那细胞的结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look closely at the cell structure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.35,0:56:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有看到什么眼熟的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see anything familiar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.59,0:56:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你早此把人类的法律破坏殆尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've already broken all the laws of man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.99,0:56:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,现在又要破坏大自然的法则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you've broken the laws of nature too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.89,0:56:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能推测你把某种装置藏在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only assume you hid a device...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.43,0:56:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,一枚被我抛入太阳的飞弹里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in a missile I hurled into the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.06,0:56:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,肌肉男先生 我以后真的会很怀念 这些闲话家常的片段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Muscle, I'm gonna really miss these little chats we have together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.07,0:57:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是唯一跟得上我的智慧的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only one who can keep up with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.70,0:57:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蓝尼  - 干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lenny!  - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.87,0:57:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我想邀大家举杯致意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna propose a toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.41,0:57:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,敬一个好人 一个即将走到终点的好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To a nice guy, who's about to finish last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.18,0:57:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,摧毁超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.29,0:57:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.15,0:57:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他有点迫不及待 你能怪他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a little bit anxious. Can you blame him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.49,0:57:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他可不是什么伟大的思想家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not one of your great thinkers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.76,0:57:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 在下我是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I, in all modesty, am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.10,0:57:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这个计划最成人的地方在于 是你协助我设计这个作品的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The touching thing about this plan is you helped me devise it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.64,0:57:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,牢狱生活使你的的思想 扭曲到一种狂乱的境界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prison has twisted your mind into a delusional state.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.04,0:57:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.34,0:57:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我脱离牢狱时 脑子里只有清楚的一件事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I escaped from prison I had one thing on my mind:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.68,0:57:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,超人之死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end of Superman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.95,0:57:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这是 我生命中…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So there I was, the first time in my life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.52,0:57:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,初次没有设计一个大规模 又是真正邪恶的犯罪计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that I didn't have a long-range, truly devious, criminal scheme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.42,0:57:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 我想到了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I came up with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.12,0:57:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有了这家伙…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With this guy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.79,0:57:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,加上你又挂了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you gone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.56,0:58:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我就可以透过全球的再武装 赚大钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'll make a fortune rearming the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.26,0:58:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你为了个人的私利 让世界冒着核战的危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd risk global nuclear war for your own personal financial gain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.07,0:58:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人想要打仗的 我只是要让这种威胁存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody wants war. I just want to keep the threat alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.24,0:58:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,俏皮吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nifty, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.45,0:58:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安了 王子阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, sweet prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.25,0:58:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,天下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parting is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.39,0:58:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,无不散筵席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.69,0:58:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,摧毁超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.06,0:58:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要先玩一玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, I have fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.39,0:59:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.27,0:59:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.10,1:05:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过 我会让你经营一家 属于你自己的报社…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I'd get you to run one of our papers yourself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.71,1:05:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是开玩笑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I meant it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.31,1:05:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜 发行人小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, Miss Publisher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.25,1:05:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 爸爸 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Daddy, that's very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.88,1:05:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,请进你的办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step into your office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.29,1:05:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是哪里来的？  - 有人送进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd this come from?  - Somebody brought it in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.16,1:05:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们买的 很便宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We bought it, cheap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.83,1:05:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好…这一次你真的太过分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay... This time you've gone too far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.20,1:05:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以发行你的三流报纸 别想用露易丝莲恩的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can print your stupid rag without Lois Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.80,1:05:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你绝对没有权利拿这东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you certainly have no right to this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.74,1:06:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 露易丝 我很抱歉  - 让她走 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lois, I'm sorry!  - Let her go, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.88,1:06:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 她没有利用价值了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, she's useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.88,1:06:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你顺便也把克拉克肯特开除吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And while you're at it, fire that Clark Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.75,1:06:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他没来上班 他连电话都没打来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hasn't been around. He hasn't even telephoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.48,1:06:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我也在担心他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, I'm worried about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.95,1:06:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 小猫咪…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, kitten...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.79,1:06:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是讨论过主管跟下属 别涉及什么关系了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...didn't we have a talk about personal involvement with the help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.53,1:06:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在你可是发行人了…  - 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now that you're the publisher...  - Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.50,1:06:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 亲爱的  - 给我住口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, darling.  - Stuff it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.30,1:06:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝 露易丝 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois! Lois, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.27,1:06:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证 我跟此事无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise you I had nothing to do with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.65,1:06:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你有克拉克的消息吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you heard from Clark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.12,1:06:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.94,1:07:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.95,1:07:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 露易丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Lois.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.05,1:07:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你来做什么？  - 我就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing here?  - I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.19,1:07:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我得了重感冒 你就知道 是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just have a really bad flu. What do you mean you knew it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.19,1:07:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.99,1:07:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你没去上班 你没打电话进办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't been to work. You haven't called the office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.10,1:07:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你连我的电话都不回 你怎么可以不回我的电话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't even called me back. How could you not call me back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.34,1:07:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 无论如何 我相信你有你的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, I guess you've got your reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.31,1:07:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗？我早知道你在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I knew you were here, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.78,1:07:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道怎么搞的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.68,1:07:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就是有某种力量把我拉过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...something pulled me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.12,1:07:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只要超人有麻烦 我就会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always know when Superman's in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.42,1:07:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,超人？他出什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman? Something's happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.32,1:07:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都说他死了 可是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody's saying that he's dead but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.79,1:08:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不是真的 我说是知道 我的内心可以威受到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that can't be true, I just know it. I feel it in my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.10,1:08:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他只是需要协助而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he just needs help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.77,1:08:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,无论他在哪里 露易丝 我相信他会撑过难关的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever he is, Lois, I'm sure he'll manage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.04,1:08:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 如果他撑不过去…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if he can't manage...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.01,1:08:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他真的有麻烦了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and if he really is in trouble...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.84,1:08:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那我有几件事想要告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then there's a few things I'd like to tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.18,1:08:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我要告诉他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd tell him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.72,1:08:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我会永远珍惜与他共度的时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that I will always cherish the time we spent together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.16,1:08:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会要求任何回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that I never expected anything in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.49,1:08:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,无论…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no matter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.16,1:08:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我见到他的时间有多么短暂 我永远威到无比的快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how few minutes I saw him for, it always made me happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.13,1:08:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要告诉他 我爱他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I would tell him that I love him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.31,1:08:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我将永远爱着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and that I'll always love him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.08,1:08:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.78,1:08:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,无论…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whatever...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.01,1:08:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,世上发生什么事情…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...happens to the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.22,1:08:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I know that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.62,1:08:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经尽力 要确保我们大家的安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he's doing his best to make sure it's all right for the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.12,1:09:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,无论他人在哪里 露易丝…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, wherever he is, Lois...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.49,1:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他会想要成谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I know that he would want to thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.57,1:09:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 我很累了 知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I'm pretty tired, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.51,1:09:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我还是在这里休息一下 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I think I'll just rest here for a while. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.74,1:09:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我会好起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.75,1:09:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.95,1:09:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 希望你觉得好多了 克拉克  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hope you feel better, Clark.  - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.26,1:09:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你有看到他 或听到他的消 急…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do see him, or hear from him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.74,1:09:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能会需要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he might need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.01,1:09:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 雷克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Lex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.78,1:10:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很高兴你帮我们卖出去 那么多的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all very pleased at all the nuclear missiles and arms...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.12,1:10:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,核子飞弹与武器…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you've helped us sell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.22,1:10:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们决定调高你的佣金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and we've decided to increase your commission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.33,1:10:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 各位 真的 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, guys, really, that's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.13,1:10:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们最起码能做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the least we could do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.93,1:10:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我有别的主意 各位先生…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I had another idea. Gentlemen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.44,1:10:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我决定要回去掌管公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I've decided to assume control of the company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.71,1:10:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我的第一步正式行动 当然此是要说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My first official act, of course, is to say:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.25,1:10:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,"你们被炒鱿鱼了 "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You're fired!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.19,1:10:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.62,1:10:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.10,1:10:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们想要推荐函找工作…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want a reference for work...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.83,1:10:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,别作梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...forget it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.77,1:10:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,表演得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a good bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.71,1:11:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 以我的智慧加上你的… 坦白说 你的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know with my brains, and your... Frankly, your...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.01,1:11:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,肌肉 各种可能性都是很可观的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...brawn, the possibilities are absolutely staggering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.75,1:11:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗？我可以成为 总统 大帝或国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I could be president, emperor, king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.25,1:11:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看到那些人有多害怕了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See how scared those guys were?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.32,1:11:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那你怕什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do you fear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.02,1:11:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？现在吗？超人死了 又有你在我的班底？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Now? With Superman dead, and you're on my team?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.43,1:11:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你就像是一股向前推进的动力 有什么好害怕的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like you're the best power forward ever. What's to fear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.38,1:11:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,氪星所剩的能源全都是你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that remains of Krypton's energy is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.69,1:11:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在能源消失后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After it is gone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.56,1:11:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你就只属于你的新家园了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... you will belong solely to your new home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.36,1:11:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们垂死的星球 能拯救你的生命 吾儿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If our dying planet can save your life, my son...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.77,1:11:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的死就有意义了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... we have not died in vain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.57,1:13:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个女人在哪里？  - 你永远找不到她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is the woman?  - You'll never find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.74,1:13:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不告诉我 我就要伤害人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you will not tell me, I will hurt people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.70,1:13:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 不要 人命关天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Don't do it, the people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.09,1:14:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 住手 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, stop! That's enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.29,1:14:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.93,1:14:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你赢了 我带你去找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You win. I'll take you to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.89,1:15:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她在哪里？  - 安全遥远的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is she?  - Far away from here and safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.16,1:15:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别进去 她不在那里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go in, she's not in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.71,1:19:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得润饰这些标题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've gotta tone down these headlines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.18,1:19:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,润饰我们的标题？ 这些都是一般人爱看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tone down our headlines? That's all the common man reads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.18,1:19:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们可以别那么煽情  - 不煽情 报社就喝西北风了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can do with less sensationalism.  - Less sensational papers go broke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.42,1:19:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我老早说教过你了 报社的经营就是做生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I taught you long ago that the business of newspapers is business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.92,1:19:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 爸爸…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Daddy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.29,1:19:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是做报导的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...our business is journalism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.86,1:19:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不可以 老是这么不负责任…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't keep being so irresponsible...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.26,1:19:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我们会把大众导向灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or we'll lead everyone into disaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.72,1:19:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别太戏剧化了 小姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be overdramatic, young lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.87,1:19:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们哪有可能 带出什么大灾难？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of disaster could we possibly help bring about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.44,1:19:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lacy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.67,1:21:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的？嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.35,1:21:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的知道自己在做什么 怀特先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you know what you're doing, Mr. White?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.55,1:21:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.42,1:21:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,华菲尔先生来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here comes Mr. Warfield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.89,1:21:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好有很好的解释…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better have a good explanation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.09,1:21:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你就要在牢里 跟你的律师说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or else you'll be talking to your lawyers from jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.26,1:21:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 我不是什么巨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm not a tycoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.97,1:22:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是一个老记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just an old reporter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.94,1:22:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我自己的报纸看很多了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've read enough in my own newspaper...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.61,1:22:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解大公司恶意的接收\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...about hostile takeovers at big companies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.91,1:22:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你 华菲尔先生 一定是睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, Mr. Warfield, must have been asleep at the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.88,1:22:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我已经说服 这个城市的银行家…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I've convinced the bankers of this city...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.91,1:22:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的《星球日报》 应被视为一种天然资源加以保护…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that our Daily Planet should be treated like a natural resource...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.22,1:22:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,以免受到掠夺者的侵略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...protected from predators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.72,1:22:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我说服他们把钱借给我 我买下多出来的股份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I convinced them to lend me the money. I bought the outstanding shares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.99,1:22:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你 华菲尔先生 现在只是小股东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, Mr. Warfield, are now a minority shareholder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.93,1:22:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大家回去工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, back to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.83,1:22:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,说得好极了 老编\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to tell him, chief!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.74,1:22:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 人总有输赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm sorry. You win some and you lose some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.64,1:22:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这才叫报纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this is what I call a newspaper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.64,1:22:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,致赠《星球日报》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compliments of The Daily Planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.25,1:22:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝你有美好的一天 我们成功了  - 我们又开张了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have a nice day. We did it!  - We're back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.69,1:22:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 我迟到了吗？  - 嗨 你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, am I late?  - Hi, how you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.99,1:22:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,让你下病床来一定很不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must've been some effort for you to drag yourself out of bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.89,1:23:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得好多了 有一个很好的护士去看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm feeling a lot better. I had a visit from a good nurse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.60,1:23:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一定带了很好的药 因为她说你病得很重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must've been good medicine because she said you were really ill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.13,1:23:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有的时候 只要有正确的人 给予适当关注就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes all you need is loving attention from the right person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.10,1:23:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你回来了 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad you're back, Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.01,1:23:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了 我要采访超人的记者会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And remember I am covering Superman's press conference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.28,1:23:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你只要收录大众的反应就好  - 反应 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just tape reactions from the crowd.  - Reactions, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.55,1:23:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.75,1:23:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我需要一部录音机吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess I need a tape recorder, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.75,1:23:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马上回来  - 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Be right back.  - Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.98,1:23:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克还是老样子 改不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same old Mr. Kent. He'll never change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.05,1:23:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.46,1:23:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好吗 超人？  - 露易丝 见到你真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing, Superman?  - Lois, good to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.87,1:23:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.74,1:23:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,早安 各位先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.47,1:23:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.21,1:23:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.51,1:23:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再一次 我们渡过战争的威胁 又找回脆弱的和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once more, we survived the threat of war and found a fragile peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.11,1:23:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾以为我能带给大家 免于战争的自由…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I could give you freedom from war but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.25,1:23:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 我错了 这种自由不是我能给的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I was wrong. It's not mine to give.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.65,1:24:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是很年轻的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still a young planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.02,1:24:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,外面的银河系还有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are galaxies out there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.13,1:24:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的文明 可让我们探寻 供我们学习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...other civilizations for us to meet, to learn from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.26,1:24:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的未来将是光明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a brilliant future we could have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.73,1:24:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等到我们这星球的人民 开始真正的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there will be peace when the people of the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.04,1:24:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,企盼和平时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...want it so badly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.74,1:24:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,所有政府就不得不 给予人民和平的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...their governments will have to give it to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.31,1:24:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望大家都能看到 我眼中的地球…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you could see the Earth the way that I see it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.38,1:24:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,因为只要仔细看着地球 就会发现 地球真的是一个大家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because when you really look at it, it's just one world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.25,1:24:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你想他会找到我们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think he'll find us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.09,1:24:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 我们先沉潜一阵子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never. We'll lay low for a while...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.66,1:24:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,过几年 我再想个新的计划出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a couple of years. I'll come up with a new plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.63,1:24:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还好我有带我的鼓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good thing I bought my drums.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.78,1:25:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克斯伯伯 你不会相信的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncle Lex, you're not gonna believe this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.58,1:25:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不过 是超人  - 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...but it's Superman!  - Superman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.59,1:25:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 酷毙了  - 早安 神父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, this rocks!  - Morning, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.46,1:25:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这个小孩受到不良的影响 你能协助他改邪归正吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This kid's been under a bad influence. Can you help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.36,1:25:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 每一个孩子都可以矫正  - 我想你是正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Every boy can be helped.  - I think you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.23,1:25:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝你幸运 孩子  - 跟我来 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good luck, son.  - Come with me, friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.43,1:25:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你们该不会有鼓可打吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't happen to have a drum set?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.77,1:25:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 莫札特回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mozart's back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.54,1:25:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老歪 莫札特回来了  - 我看到了 老土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Duane, Mozart's back!  - I see him, Bubba!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.75,1:25:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.12,1:25:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 警官 带他走  - 谢谢你 超人 过来 路瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, take him away.  - Thank you. Come on, Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.16,1:25:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只问一件事 你怎么打败他的？  - 高中物理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just one thing, how did you beat him?  - High school physics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.93,1:25:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我正好有点时间想到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had time to figure out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.13,1:25:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那东西是从太阳生出来的 就一定是太阳给的能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that if it was born from the sun, that had to be its energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.03,1:25:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 世界会被蒸发掉吗？  - 不会的 路瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is the world gonna be vaporized?  - No, Luthor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.20,1:25:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,事情总是这样的 总在危险边缘 正义迎战邪恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's as it always was, on the brink, with good fighting evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.64,1:25:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,20年后再见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you in 20.{\r}
